1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,485
Shakuni ka badla, Mahabharat ke text mein hai hi nahi?

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:06,621
Jis kahani ne Shakuni ko hero jaisa bana diya,

3
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:10,455
woh purane text mein milti hi nahi. Toh aayi kahan se?

4
00:00:10,455 --> 00:00:12,808
Aapne yeh kahani zaroor suni hogi.

5
00:00:12,808 --> 00:00:15,946
Shakuni ka poora parivaar qaid mein bhookha mara.

6
00:00:15,946 --> 00:00:17,907
Aur Shakuni ne kasam khayi,

7
00:00:17,907 --> 00:00:20,653
Kuru vansh ko andar se khatam karunga.

8
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:22,614
Kitni bhayanak kasam hai na?

9
00:00:22,614 --> 00:00:24,302
Kahani yahan nahi rukti.

10
00:00:24,302 --> 00:00:28,944
Kehte hain uske pasey uske pita ki haddiyon se bane the.

11
00:00:28,944 --> 00:00:33,585
Jo Shakuni bolta, wahi girta. Rongte khade ho jaate hain na?

12
00:00:33,585 --> 00:00:35,273
Par sach kya hai?

13
00:00:35,273 --> 00:00:37,130
Lekin yahan twist hai.

14
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:42,699
Sabse jaanche-parkhe Sanskrit text mein yeh qaid wali kahani hai hi nahi.

15
00:00:42,699 --> 00:00:46,876
Wahan toh Shakuni ke pita Subala zinda dikhte hain,

16
00:00:46,876 --> 00:00:48,733
shahi samaroh mein baithe.

17
00:00:48,733 --> 00:00:51,797
Aur mitti bhi kuch keh rahi hai.

18
00:00:51,797 --> 00:00:55,737
Hastinapur ki khudai mein khel ke purane mohre mile.

19
00:00:55,737 --> 00:01:00,114
Gandhar ki purani raajdhani bhi mili. Toh kahani aur sabut,

20
00:01:00,114 --> 00:01:01,427
kahan milte hain?

21
00:01:01,427 --> 00:01:05,504
Is video mein har baat par label milega. Kya scripture hai,

22
00:01:05,504 --> 00:01:09,211
kya lokkatha, aur kahan vidvaan ladte hain. Par pehle chaliye,

23
00:01:09,211 --> 00:01:11,806
us sabha mein jahan pasey phenke gaye.

24
00:01:11,806 --> 00:01:16,668
Mahabharat ka ek hissa hai, Sabha Parva. Parva yaani adhyaay,

25
00:01:16,668 --> 00:01:21,531
ek bada chapter. Isi chapter mein woh khel hota hai,

26
00:01:21,531 --> 00:01:25,421
jisne poori kahani ka rukh badal diya. Kaise?

27
00:01:25,421 --> 00:01:30,066
Hastinapur ka mahal. Saamne Duryodhan aur Kaurav bhai.

28
00:01:30,066 --> 00:01:35,873
Unke saamne Yudhishthir aur Pandav. Beech mein pasey ka takhta.

29
00:01:35,873 --> 00:01:41,679
Aur Duryodhan ki jagah pasey phenkta hai uska mama, Shakuni.

30
00:01:41,679 --> 00:01:46,339
Shakuni kaun tha? Gandhar ka rajkumar, raja Subala ka beta.

31
00:01:46,339 --> 00:01:50,533
Aur Gandhari ka bhai, yaani Duryodhan ka sagaa mama.

32
00:01:50,533 --> 00:01:55,659
Rishta ghar ka tha, par khel dushmani ka. Dilchasp hai na?

33
00:01:55,659 --> 00:02:00,190
Text mein Shakuni Duryodhan ka salaahkaar hai, pasey ka mahir khiladi.

34
00:02:00,190 --> 00:02:03,486
Yudhishthir ko khel se inkaar karna nahi aata.

35
00:02:03,486 --> 00:02:08,017
Aur Duryodhan ko yahi kamzori chahiye thi. Jaal bichh chuka tha.

36
00:02:08,017 --> 00:02:12,950
Daav lagte hain. Pehle dhan, phir sona, phir rath aur ghode.

37
00:02:12,950 --> 00:02:16,985
Har baar pasey Shakuni ke haq mein girte hain.

38
00:02:16,985 --> 00:02:21,918
Sabha mein sannata chha jaata hai. Kisi ko yakeen nahi hota.

39
00:02:21,918 --> 00:02:25,489
Phir Yudhishthir apna rajya haar jaate hain. Phir apne bhai.

40
00:02:25,489 --> 00:02:27,274
Phir khud ko bhi. Socho,

41
00:02:27,274 --> 00:02:30,845
ek raja jo apne aap ko daav par laga de.

42
00:02:30,845 --> 00:02:32,987
Aur phir bhi khel nahi rukta.

43
00:02:32,987 --> 00:02:34,949
Aur phir sabse kaala pal.

44
00:02:34,949 --> 00:02:37,696
Draupadi ko daav par lagaya jaata hai.

45
00:02:37,696 --> 00:02:40,051
Woh bhi haar di jaati hai.

46
00:02:40,051 --> 00:02:43,975
Mahabharat ke sabse dardnaak drishyon mein se yeh ek hai.

47
00:02:43,975 --> 00:02:46,992
Is poore khel mein Shakuni kya hai?

48
00:02:46,992 --> 00:02:51,734
Text mein woh Duryodhan ka chaalaak salaahkaar hai. Chaal chalne wala,

49
00:02:51,734 --> 00:02:55,614
pasey ka mahir. Par badle ki koi gupt kasam?

50
00:02:55,614 --> 00:02:57,338
Woh kahin nahi dikhti.

51
00:02:57,338 --> 00:03:00,814
Toh sawaal uthta hai. Agar text mein badla nahi,

52
00:03:00,814 --> 00:03:03,517
toh woh dukhbhari kahani kahan se aayi?

53
00:03:03,517 --> 00:03:07,765
Jawab chhupa hai gaon ki chaupal aur natak ke manch par.

54
00:03:07,765 --> 00:03:08,537
Chaliye wahan.

55
00:03:08,537 --> 00:03:10,779
Ab chalte hain lokkatha ki taraf.

56
00:03:10,779 --> 00:03:14,514
Lokkatha yaani woh kahani jo pidhi dar pidhi sunayi gayi.

57
00:03:14,514 --> 00:03:18,624
Zubaan se zubaan chali, par purane text mein likhi nahi mili.

58
00:03:18,624 --> 00:03:22,633
Is kahani mein Gandhari ki shaadi Dhritarashtra se hoti hai.

59
00:03:22,633 --> 00:03:26,643
Par phir Gandhar ke parivaar par musibat toot padti hai.

60
00:03:26,643 --> 00:03:30,251
Raja Subala aur unke bete qaid ho jaate hain.

61
00:03:30,251 --> 00:03:34,064
Kehte hain Dhritarashtra ne unhe kaal-kothri mein band karwa diya.

62
00:03:34,064 --> 00:03:37,496
Khaane ko bas chawal ke gine-chune daane. Itne kam,

63
00:03:37,496 --> 00:03:40,547
ki kisi ka pet bhar hi na sake.

64
00:03:40,547 --> 00:03:44,473
Tab raja Subala bada faisla karte hain. Sab bhookhe rahenge,

65
00:03:44,473 --> 00:03:46,828
par khana sirf Shakuni ko milega.

66
00:03:46,828 --> 00:03:49,969
Kyunki usi ko zinda rehna hai. Kis liye?

67
00:03:49,969 --> 00:03:51,539
Badla lene ke liye.

68
00:03:51,539 --> 00:03:56,698
Socho us kothri ka manzar. Bhai bari bari dam todte hain.

69
00:03:56,698 --> 00:04:01,387
Aur Shakuni sab dekhta hai, chupchaap, aankhon mein aag liye.

70
00:04:01,387 --> 00:04:04,201
Lokkatha ka asli dard yahin hai.

71
00:04:04,201 --> 00:04:07,725
Lokkatha kehti hai, Shakuni ko isiliye bachaya gaya.

72
00:04:07,725 --> 00:04:10,809
Taaki woh Hastinapur ke andar reh kar,

73
00:04:10,809 --> 00:04:15,215
Kuru vansh ko jad se khatam kar sake. Ek lamba,

74
00:04:15,215 --> 00:04:16,096
thanda intezaar.

75
00:04:16,096 --> 00:04:18,574
Ab aata hai sabse ajeeb hissa.

76
00:04:18,574 --> 00:04:21,051
Raja Subala ki maut ke baad,

77
00:04:21,051 --> 00:04:23,942
Shakuni unki haddi se pasey banata hai.

78
00:04:23,942 --> 00:04:27,658
Kuch kehte jaangh ki haddi, kuch kehte reedh ki.

79
00:04:27,658 --> 00:04:32,090
In paso ki khaasiyat? Woh Shakuni ka hukm maante the.

80
00:04:32,090 --> 00:04:34,306
Jo woh bolta, wahi girta.

81
00:04:34,306 --> 00:04:39,181
Isiliye Yudhishthir kabhi jeet hi nahi paaye. Kahani yahi kehti hai.

82
00:04:39,181 --> 00:04:44,031
Yeh kahani Amar Chitra Katha jaisi kitabon ke folklore mein bhi aayi.

83
00:04:44,031 --> 00:04:48,072
Aur yahin se Shakuni ka naya chehra bana. Khalnayak nahi,

84
00:04:48,072 --> 00:04:50,093
ek dukhi bhai aur beta.

85
00:04:50,093 --> 00:04:52,606
Lekin label yaad rakhiye, yeh lokkatha hai.

86
00:04:52,606 --> 00:04:55,119
Iska source koi purana Sanskrit text nahi.

87
00:04:55,119 --> 00:04:57,273
Toh asli text kya kehta hai?

88
00:04:57,273 --> 00:04:59,427
Wahan twist aur bhi bada hai.

89
00:04:59,427 --> 00:05:02,132
Pehle ek shabd samjho, critical edition.

90
00:05:02,132 --> 00:05:07,090
Yaani bahut saari purani pandulipiyon ko mila kar banaya gaya text.

91
00:05:07,090 --> 00:05:12,048
Pandulipi yaani haath se likhi purani kitab. Sabse jaancha hua Mahabharat.

92
00:05:12,048 --> 00:05:15,052
Vidvaanon ne alag alag ilaakon ki pandulipiyan milaayi.

93
00:05:15,052 --> 00:05:17,680
Jo hissa sab mein milta, woh rakha.

94
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:20,684
Jo baad mein juda laga, use alag kiya.

95
00:05:20,684 --> 00:05:22,186
Bilkul detective jaisa kaam.

96
00:05:22,186 --> 00:05:27,467
Aur is text mein Gandhar ke parivaar ki qaid wali kahani hai hi nahi.

97
00:05:27,467 --> 00:05:31,617
Na bhookh, na kaal-kothri, na haddiyon wale pasey. Kuch bhi nahi.

98
00:05:31,617 --> 00:05:32,371
Hairaani hui?

99
00:05:32,371 --> 00:05:35,635
Ulta, text mein raja Subala zinda dikhte hain.

100
00:05:35,635 --> 00:05:38,898
Woh shahi samarohon mein aate hain, mehmaan bankar.

101
00:05:38,898 --> 00:05:42,162
Toh jis pita ki haddi se pasey bane,

102
00:05:42,162 --> 00:05:43,794
woh toh zinda tha?

103
00:05:43,794 --> 00:05:46,010
Yahin kahani palat jaati hai.

104
00:05:46,010 --> 00:05:50,884
Text ka Shakuni ek chaalaak salaahkaar hai, Duryodhan ke paksh ka.

105
00:05:50,884 --> 00:05:55,758
Uski chaal mein badla nahi dikhta. Dikhta hai Duryodhan ka faayda.

106
00:05:55,758 --> 00:05:59,891
Matlab text ke hisaab se Shakuni ka koi gupt mission nahi tha.

107
00:05:59,891 --> 00:06:03,336
Woh bas apne bhaanje ko jitaana chahta tha. Seedhi baat,

108
00:06:03,336 --> 00:06:05,058
lokkatha se bilkul alag tasveer.

109
00:06:05,058 --> 00:06:09,159
Toh kya Mahabharat ki duniya bas kalpana hai? Kya pasey,

110
00:06:09,159 --> 00:06:12,440
Hastinapur aur Gandhar sirf kahani ke naam hain?

111
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:16,541
Iska jawab text mein nahi, mitti ke neeche dabaa hai.

112
00:06:16,541 --> 00:06:21,751
Chaliye Hastinapur. Uttar Pradesh mein, Ganga ki purani dhaara ke paas,

113
00:06:21,751 --> 00:06:26,488
ek purana teela hai. Teela yaani mitti ka ooncha dher,

114
00:06:26,488 --> 00:06:29,804
jiske neeche purani bastiyan dabi hoti hain.

115
00:06:29,804 --> 00:06:34,315
Archaeological Survey of India, yaani ASI. Desh ki sarkari sanstha,

116
00:06:34,315 --> 00:06:38,374
jo purani jagahon ki khudai aur dekhbhaal karti hai.

117
00:06:38,374 --> 00:06:42,434
ASI ki team Hastinapur ke is teele par pahunchi.

118
00:06:42,434 --> 00:06:45,365
Khudai chali 1950 se 1952 tak.

119
00:06:45,365 --> 00:06:48,784
Mitti ki parat dar parat jaanch hui.

120
00:06:48,784 --> 00:06:53,181
Har parat ek alag zamana, jaise kitab ke panne,

121
00:06:53,181 --> 00:06:55,135
neeche wala sabse purana.

122
00:06:55,135 --> 00:06:58,641
Ek parat mein mile Painted Grey Ware ke bartan.

123
00:06:58,641 --> 00:07:00,589
Yaani saleti rang ke bartan,

124
00:07:00,589 --> 00:07:04,095
jin par kaale rang se design bane hote the.

125
00:07:04,095 --> 00:07:06,433
Yeh ek khaas purana zamana tha.

126
00:07:06,433 --> 00:07:10,708
Aur isi zamane ki parat mein mili ek khaas cheez.

127
00:07:10,708 --> 00:07:15,411
Chhoti golakaar tikiyaan, terracotta ki. Terracotta yaani aag mein paki mitti.

128
00:07:15,411 --> 00:07:17,121
Inka kaam kya tha?

129
00:07:17,121 --> 00:07:21,903
ASI ke vidvaanon ne inhe kya maana? Khel ke mohre.

130
00:07:21,903 --> 00:07:26,207
Yaani gaming counters, jaise aaj ludo ki gotiyan. Socho,

131
00:07:26,207 --> 00:07:29,555
Hastinapur ki mitti mein khel ke mohre!

132
00:07:29,555 --> 00:07:33,225
Par dhyaan rakhiye. Yeh mohre Shakuni ke nahi hain.

133
00:07:33,225 --> 00:07:37,710
Inpar kisi ka naam nahi likha. Yeh bas itna batate hain,

134
00:07:37,710 --> 00:07:40,156
ki yahan log khel khelte the.

135
00:07:40,156 --> 00:07:45,149
Matlab khel ki sanskriti Hastinapur mein thi, yeh mitti maanti hai.

136
00:07:45,149 --> 00:07:48,780
Lekin pasey ki woh sabha sach mein hui,

137
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:52,411
yeh koi khudai sabit nahi karti. Farq samjhiye.

138
00:07:52,411 --> 00:07:56,477
Toh Hastinapur ka hisaab ho gaya. Ab doosra sawaal.

139
00:07:56,477 --> 00:08:00,543
Shakuni ka ghar, Gandhar. Woh jagah sach mein thi,

140
00:08:00,543 --> 00:08:04,157
ya bas kahani ka ek naam? Chaliye uttar-pashchim.

141
00:08:04,157 --> 00:08:09,862
Gandhar, purane Bharat ka uttar-pashchimi ilaaka. Pahaad, ghaatiyan aur nadiyan.

142
00:08:09,862 --> 00:08:16,137
Kahani kehti hai, yahin se Gandhari bahu bankar Hastinapur aayi thi.

143
00:08:16,137 --> 00:08:18,990
Par mitti kya kehti hai?

144
00:08:18,990 --> 00:08:21,787
Gandhar ki raajdhani mani jaati thi Takshashila,

145
00:08:21,787 --> 00:08:23,785
jise Taxila bhi kehte hain.

146
00:08:23,785 --> 00:08:26,582
Yahan khudai ki Sir John Marshall ne,

147
00:08:26,582 --> 00:08:28,979
Archaeological Survey of India ke liye.

148
00:08:28,979 --> 00:08:34,014
Yeh kaam chala 1913 se 1934 tak. Lambi, dheemi khudai.

149
00:08:34,014 --> 00:08:39,552
Aur mitti ke neeche se nikli parat dar parat basi bastiyan.

150
00:08:39,552 --> 00:08:42,069
Ek purana shehar jaag utha.

151
00:08:42,069 --> 00:08:46,030
Sabse purani basti mili Bhir Mound naam ke teele par.

152
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:48,011
Wahan gharon ki neev, galiyan,

153
00:08:48,011 --> 00:08:50,784
aur roz ki zindagi ke nishaan mile.

154
00:08:50,784 --> 00:08:53,161
Log yahan sach mein rehte the.

155
00:08:53,161 --> 00:08:56,346
Toh Gandhar koi kalpana ka desh nahi tha.

156
00:08:56,346 --> 00:08:59,133
Woh asli raajya tha, asli shehron wala.

157
00:08:59,133 --> 00:09:03,512
Yeh ASI ki khudai saaf dikhati hai. Ab twist ki baari.

158
00:09:03,512 --> 00:09:05,408
Lekin yahan bhi wahi baat.

159
00:09:05,408 --> 00:09:08,441
Taxila mein Shakuni ka koi nishaan nahi mila.

160
00:09:08,441 --> 00:09:11,096
Na mahal par naam, na koi shilalekh.

161
00:09:11,096 --> 00:09:13,371
Shilalekh yaani patthar par likhi baat.

162
00:09:13,371 --> 00:09:18,112
Toh tasveer yeh bani. Jagah asli, khel asli, mohre asli.

163
00:09:18,112 --> 00:09:21,904
Par badle ki kahani? Uska sabut kahin nahi.

164
00:09:21,904 --> 00:09:25,697
Toh vidvaan aakhir kis baat par ladte hain?

165
00:09:25,697 --> 00:09:29,463
Pehla jhagda. Yeh badle wali kahani shuru kab hui?

166
00:09:29,463 --> 00:09:31,555
Vidvaan isme bant gaye hain.

167
00:09:31,555 --> 00:09:36,157
Aur dono taraf ke tark kaafi dilchasp hain. Suniye dhyaan se.

168
00:09:36,157 --> 00:09:40,822
Kuch vidvaan kehte hain, yeh kahani purani lok-natak parampara se aayi.

169
00:09:40,822 --> 00:09:42,942
Jaise Tamil Nadu ka Terukkuttu,

170
00:09:42,942 --> 00:09:46,759
gaon ki galiyon mein raat bhar chalne wala natak.

171
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:48,666
Ya uttar Bharat ki Nautanki,

172
00:09:48,666 --> 00:09:52,098
jahan gaayak aur kalakaar mele mein kahani gaate the.

173
00:09:52,098 --> 00:09:54,768
In manchon par kahaniyan badalti rehti thi,

174
00:09:54,768 --> 00:09:57,056
darshak ke dil ke hisaab se.

175
00:09:57,056 --> 00:10:01,214
Doosre vidvaan kehte hain, nahi. Yeh kahani zyada nayi hai.

176
00:10:01,214 --> 00:10:07,451
Aaj ke zamane ke stage natak aur TV serial ne isse badha chadha kar failaya.

177
00:10:07,451 --> 00:10:08,283
Kaun sahi?

178
00:10:08,283 --> 00:10:12,240
Unka tark seedha hai. Purane likhe hue sabut kam hain.

179
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,219
Aur dukhi Shakuni ka chehra,

180
00:10:14,219 --> 00:10:18,176
TV aur natak ke zariye lagbhag har ghar tak pahuncha.

181
00:10:18,176 --> 00:10:20,892
Ab doosra jhagda, aur bhi gehra.

182
00:10:20,892 --> 00:10:24,966
Pasey ka khel asal mein tha kya? Seedha dhokha,

183
00:10:24,966 --> 00:10:29,493
ya koi purani dharmik rasm? Yahan bhi vidvaan aamne-saamne hain.

184
00:10:29,493 --> 00:10:32,951
Kuch kehte hain, yeh saaf chaal-baazi thi.

185
00:10:32,951 --> 00:10:37,396
Ek chaalaak khiladi ne bhole raja ko haraya, bas.

186
00:10:37,396 --> 00:10:41,348
Isme koi rahasya nahi, sirf hunar aur dhokha.

187
00:10:41,348 --> 00:10:45,628
Doosre kehte hain, isme Vedic Rajasuya yagya ki chhaap hai.

188
00:10:45,628 --> 00:10:48,624
Rajasuya yaani raja banne ka bada yagya.

189
00:10:48,624 --> 00:10:52,904
Usme pasey ka khel bhi ek rasm maani jaati thi.

190
00:10:52,904 --> 00:10:56,633
Aur dilchasp baat, Yudhishthir ne Rajasuya yagya kiya tha,

191
00:10:56,633 --> 00:10:58,290
Sabha Parva mein hi.

192
00:10:58,290 --> 00:11:02,848
Toh kya pasey ka khel usi purani parampara ki goonj tha?

193
00:11:02,848 --> 00:11:06,005
Agar yeh sach hai, toh Shakuni sirf dhokebaaz nahi.

194
00:11:06,005 --> 00:11:08,460
Woh ek purani rasm ka khiladi hai.

195
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:12,319
Par yeh bhi tay nahi hua. Bahas abhi bhi khuli hai.

196
00:11:12,319 --> 00:11:14,951
Ab woh baat jo koi nahi jaanta.

197
00:11:14,951 --> 00:11:18,710
Badle wali kahani pehli baar kab aur kahan sunayi gayi?

198
00:11:18,710 --> 00:11:22,470
Kisi ke paas iska saaf jawab nahi. Ajeeb hai na?

199
00:11:22,470 --> 00:11:25,274
Kis gaon mein, kis natak mandali ne,

200
00:11:25,274 --> 00:11:28,077
pehli baar Shakuni ko dukhi bhai banaya?

201
00:11:28,077 --> 00:11:30,080
Woh pal kho gaya hai.

202
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:32,883
Jaise hawa mein ud gayi koi baat.

203
00:11:32,883 --> 00:11:34,635
Aur haddiyon wale pasey?

204
00:11:34,635 --> 00:11:39,890
Unka koi purana likhit roop is kahani ke sabut mein nahi milta.

205
00:11:39,890 --> 00:11:44,708
Woh kahani zubaan se zubaan chali, kitabon tak baad mein pahunchi.

206
00:11:44,708 --> 00:11:49,486
Toh Shakuni ka chehra badal gaya hai. Text mein chaalaak salaahkaar.

207
00:11:49,486 --> 00:11:52,527
Lokkatha mein dukhi, badla lene wala bhai.

208
00:11:52,527 --> 00:11:56,437
Dono hamari virasat ka hissa hain. Par alag alag.

209
00:11:56,437 --> 00:11:59,300
Ab aap khud kya dekh sakte hain?

210
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:03,389
Hastinapur ka purana teela aaj bhi Uttar Pradesh mein hai.

211
00:12:03,389 --> 00:12:07,479
Ganga ki purani dhaara ke paas, khamosh khada intezaar karta.

212
00:12:07,479 --> 00:12:09,513
Wahan khade ho kar sochiye.

213
00:12:09,513 --> 00:12:13,582
Isi mitti ki paraton se khel ke mohre nikle the.

214
00:12:13,582 --> 00:12:17,245
Shayad kisi bachche ne, kisi shaam, inse khela ho.

215
00:12:17,245 --> 00:12:19,279
Rongte khade karne wali baat.

216
00:12:19,279 --> 00:12:23,647
Mahabharat ki kahaniyan aaj bhi gaon ke manch par zinda hain.

217
00:12:23,647 --> 00:12:26,426
Kisi mele mein Terukkuttu ya Nautanki dekhiye.

218
00:12:26,426 --> 00:12:30,000
Shakuni ka kaun sa roop milta hai, dhyaan dijiye.

219
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:34,100
Aur ghar par Mahabharat ka Sabha Parva padhiye. Khud dekhiye,

220
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:36,970
Shakuni kya kehta hai, kya karta hai.

221
00:12:36,970 --> 00:12:41,480
Tab sabut kisi aur ka nahi, aapke apne haath mein hoga.

222
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,480
Toh shuruaat ka sawaal yaad hai?

223
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:46,814
Shakuni ka badla Mahabharat ke text mein hai ya nahi?

224
00:12:46,814 --> 00:12:49,814
Jawab mil gaya. Text mein nahi, lokkatha mein hai.

225
00:12:49,814 --> 00:12:52,049
Lekin isse lokkatha chhoti nahi hoti.

226
00:12:52,049 --> 00:12:56,147
Woh dikhati hai ki log khalnayak mein bhi dard dhoondhte hain.

227
00:12:56,147 --> 00:12:58,755
Yahi hamari kahaniyon ki asli taakat hai.

228
00:12:58,755 --> 00:13:00,776
Agle video mein chalenge Kurukshetra.

229
00:13:00,776 --> 00:13:03,606
Woh maidan jahan yeh sab khatam hua.

230
00:13:03,606 --> 00:13:07,243
Wahan ki mitti kya kehti hai? Sabut ke saath,

231
00:13:07,243 --> 00:13:08,456
wahin milte hain.

232
00:13:08,456 --> 00:13:15,985
Ab aapki baari. Aapke hisaab se Shakuni khalnayak tha,

233
00:13:15,985 --> 00:13:24,350
ya badle ka shikaar? Comment mein bas ek shabd likhiye,

234
00:13:24,350 --> 00:13:28,533
khalnayak ya shikaar. Main padhunga.
